  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Pacific 2023 Good Governance Short Course</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This Activity aims to deliver&#xA0; Good Governance short term training scholarships to 30 scholars from Samoa, Tonga, Niue, Tokelau, Tuvalu, Kiribati,&#xA0; Nauru, Fiji, Vanuatu, Solomon Islands and PNG.
The course will be delivered November 2023 in Auckland, by the University of Auckland&apos;s Public Policy Institute.</narrative>
  </description>
